        ("Virtual environments and packaging", "STUDY METHOD\nRecord the command needed to create, activate, install, and run the project.\n\nCORE CONTENT\nA requirements file pins runtime dependencies. pyproject.toml describes metadata and tooling. Avoid committing secrets and local environment folders.\n\nPRACTICE\nPackage a CLI and document setup in README. Run it outside the editor terminal.\n\nJOB-READY CHECK\nExplain a lock file, dependency range, and transitive dependency."),
