        ("Design and tradeoffs", "STUDY METHOD\nList options, constraints, benefits, costs, and reversibility.\n\nCORE CONTENT\nArchitecture is a set of boundaries and dependencies. Prefer boring, proven choices until requirements justify complexity. Record important decisions.\n\nPRACTICE\nCompare monolith and microservices for a small team and explain which you would choose.\n\nJOB-READY CHECK\nExplain coupling, cohesion, and a design tradeoff."),
