        ("Security fundamentals", "STUDY METHOD\nInspect every trust boundary: browser, API, database, file system, dependency, and logs.\n\nCORE CONTENT\nValidate input, encode output, use parameterized queries, enforce authorization, manage secrets, keep dependencies patched, and rate-limit abuse.\n\nPRACTICE\nThreat-model course enrollment and list mitigations for unauthorized completion and token misuse.\n\nJOB-READY CHECK\nExplain OWASP risks and secure code review."),
